      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Malcolm%2C_Nebraska",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Malcolm was platted in 1877, with a formal land plat filed on October 13 of that year.",
